# =============================================================================
# auto-agent — environment example
# =============================================================================
# The deployed system needs NO local environment file. It runs entirely inside
# Google Apps Script, and the only secret it can ever hold — an optional AI API
# key — is stored in Apps Script Script Properties, never on disk and never in
# this repository.
#
#   In the Apps Script editor:  run setApiKey()  and paste the key into the
#   prompt. It is written to PropertiesService.getScriptProperties().
#   Remove it later with clearApiKey().
#
# The variables below are only relevant if you later add a local script that
# talks to the same services. Copy this file to .env (which is gitignored) if
# you do.
# =============================================================================

# Optional: only if you build a local tool that calls the same AI provider.
# The deployed Apps Script does NOT read this.
AI_API_KEY=

# Optional: only if you script the Apps Script deployment with clasp.
# CLASP_SCRIPT_ID=
